# DUSKLING R5, STONE FACES (room 33): three stone faces, each one showing the way to the next.
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder (cheat solve).
game duskling
wait 5
cheat room 33
hold A 2
wait 2
